WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.968
-The criminal contempt trial
of top Trump ally

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.300
Steve Bannon began today

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.167
after he refused to cooperate
with the committee

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.133
investigating the January 6th
insurrection.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.734
The committee also revealed

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.400
that Trump had personally
attempted to contact a witness

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.968
in the investigation.
Despite all that,

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.634
top Republicans
are still sticking by Trump

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:20.167
as he signals that he's likely
to run again in 2024.

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:21.501
And on top of all that,

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.567
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin once again

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.000
torpedoed the Democrat's
domestic agenda in Congress.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.968
For more on this, it's time
for a new segment we call

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.901
"Well, That All Sounds
Like a Bummer!"

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:36.434
♪♪

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:38.434
Oh, wait, I forgot. We already
have a segment like that.

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.033
It's called "A Closer Look."

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.234
♪♪

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:46.167
I'm sorry, it's just we have
been off for two weeks

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:48.434
and I totally forgot
how the show works.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:51.000
Anyway, things have not
exactly been going great

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.734
for Joe Biden
and the Democrats lately.

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.767
Prominent Democrats,
both outside

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:56.234
and inside the White House,

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.200
have criticized Biden's
slow response

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.133
to the Supreme Court's decision
to overturn Roe v. Wade.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.467
