a murderous tyrant.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.033
Now, I know you did that

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:19.667
because you didn't want
to be seen shaking his hand,

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:22.634
but a fist bump is way worse.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.067
