it's two world leaders,

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:27.868
like it or not,
so that's standard enough."

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:31.267
But a fist bump makes it look
like you just hit a homerun

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.701
in the company softball game.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.434
"Hey, nice one, MBS.

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:36.934
I think this is the year
we're finally going to beat

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:39.901
Dave's Heating and Cooling."

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:42.000
Once again,
as we have said before,

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.434
this is a good reminder
that it would be great

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.834
