Also, if you're thinking
to yourself,

00:11:00.901 --> 00:11:02.067
"Wait, wasn't Steve Bannon

00:11:02.067 --> 00:11:03.767
already arrested
for a different crime?"

00:11:03.767 --> 00:11:05.234
The answer is yes,
he was charged

00:11:05.234 --> 00:11:06.601
with defrauding Trump supporters

00:11:06.601 --> 00:11:08.767
as part of a scam fundraiser
to build the wall

00:11:08.767 --> 00:11:12.467
and was arrested on a fugitive
Chinese billionaire's yacht

00:11:12.467 --> 00:11:15.200
by Postal Service cops
before Trump pardoned him.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.434
Yet another series of words
that is both insane

00:11:19.434 --> 00:11:21.334
and will be mostly forgotten
to history

00:11:21.334 --> 00:11:23.701
because too much other
crazy [bleep] has happened.

00:11:23.701 --> 00:11:26.234
That would be like reading
a history book

00:11:26.234 --> 00:11:27.834
and finding out that
for a little while

00:11:27.834 --> 00:11:29.167
in his early 20s,

00:11:29.167 --> 00:11:33.701
Abraham Lincoln switched
from stovepipe hats to fedoras.

00:11:33.701 --> 00:11:35.434
"They call me Abe,
and if I'm being honest,

00:11:35.434 --> 00:11:37.734
I love
the Squirrel Nut Zippers."

00:11:40.167 --> 00:11:41.634
[ Laughter ]

00:11:41.634 --> 00:11:43.434
You know, I burned Sal earlier

00:11:43.434 --> 00:11:45.133
because he referenced
"Friday Night Lights,"

00:11:45.133 --> 00:11:48.067
and I was -- said
that was really dated.

00:11:48.067 --> 00:11:50.367
And then I put in
the Squirrel Nut Zipper joke.

00:11:50.367 --> 00:11:54.100
[ Laughter ]

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.901
So I guess I'm the one
who got burned.

00:11:55.901 --> 00:11:57.701
[ Laughter ]

00:11:57.701 --> 00:11:59.934
Bannon's trial and the
revelations about his role

00:11:59.934 --> 00:12:01.434
in the attempted coup
are happening

00:12:01.434 --> 00:12:03.200
as the January 6th hearings
build toward

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.534
what could very well be
a shocking conclusion,

00:12:05.534 --> 00:12:07.901
even after all the shocking
revelations we've already seen

00:12:07.901 --> 00:12:09.467
about Trump's obvious
criminal liability.

00:12:09.467 --> 00:12:10.767
On top of everything else,

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:12.367
last week, the committee
also announced

00:12:12.367 --> 00:12:14.434
that Trump had personally
attempted to tamper

00:12:14.434 --> 00:12:15.701
with one of the witnesses.

00:12:15.701 --> 00:12:18.167
-After our last hearing,

00:12:18.167 --> 00:12:23.868
President Trump tried to call
a witness in our investigation.

00:12:23.868 --> 00:12:28.234
A witness you have not yet seen
in these hearings.

00:12:28.234 --> 00:12:31.434
That person declined
to answer or respond

00:12:31.434 --> 00:12:33.868
to President Trump's call

00:12:33.868 --> 00:12:37.501
and instead alerted
their lawyer to the call.

00:12:37.501 --> 00:12:40.234
Their lawyer alerted us.

00:12:40.234 --> 00:12:42.667
And this committee has supplied
that information

00:12:42.667 --> 00:12:45.133
to the Department of Justice.

00:12:45.133 --> 00:12:47.267
Let me say one more time

00:12:47.267 --> 00:12:49.300
we will take any effort

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:53.534
to influence witness testimony
very seriously.

00:12:53.534 --> 00:12:55.801
-I'll admit, before they started
this whole thing,

00:12:55.801 --> 00:12:57.834
I was afraid these hearings
would be boring,

00:12:57.834 --> 00:13:00.334
and instead, we've got
Liz Cheney doing teases

00:13:00.334 --> 00:13:03.200
like she's Robert Stack
in "Unsolved Mysteries."

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.701
"The President
of the United States

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:06.901
places a phone call,
but for what purpose?

00:13:06.901 --> 00:13:09.501
The answer to that question
and more next week

00:13:09.501 --> 00:13:12.100
on the January 6th hearings."

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.968
I do enjoy imagining Trump

00:13:13.968 --> 00:13:15.868
trying to get through
to a witness

00:13:15.868 --> 00:13:17.767
because you know
he's dumb enough

00:13:17.767 --> 00:13:20.667
to leave a voicemail message.

00:13:20.667 --> 00:13:22.868
And you know it was probably
like an hour long.

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:24.734
"Hey, Mark,
this is your friend Donald.

00:13:24.734 --> 00:13:27.567
Just calling to remind you
how much I appreciate

00:13:27.567 --> 00:13:28.934
your loyalty. I like you, Mark.

00:13:28.934 --> 00:13:32.200
I like you a lot more
than those nasty windmills.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:35.067
Windmills, they gave you cancer
and they kill your birds.

00:13:35.067 --> 00:13:38.567
Birds, we love the birds.
We love birds, don't we, Mark?

00:13:38.567 --> 00:13:41.000
The birds, they soar through
the skies majestically.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.634
It's truly a miracle of nature.

00:13:42.634 --> 00:13:44.934
I would love to be free
as a bird,

00:13:44.934 --> 00:13:47.000
but instead I remain
shackled here on earth,

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.434
entangled.

00:13:48.434 --> 00:13:51.667
I'm en-- Mark,
I'm entangled, Mark.

00:13:51.667 --> 00:13:54.033
Mark, I'm entangled
in this web of deceit

00:13:54.033 --> 00:13:56.767
I've weaved for myself.
Or is it woven?

00:13:56.767 --> 00:13:59.968
I never know if it's weaved
or it's woven, Mark.

00:13:59.968 --> 00:14:01.734
I say weaved,
and I think it's woven.

00:14:01.734 --> 00:14:04.467
I say woven.
I think it's weaved.

00:14:04.467 --> 00:14:06.934
I'm always going to stumble
on grammar, Mark. You know that.

00:14:06.934 --> 00:14:09.634
But the point is, Mark,
oh, to be a bird.

00:14:09.634 --> 00:14:12.234
I --"
-Mailbox full. Goodbye.

00:14:12.234 --> 00:14:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:16.133 --> 00:14:17.334
-The Republican Party

00:14:17.334 --> 00:14:19.934
has fully descended
into authoritarianism

00:14:19.934 --> 00:14:22.267
and they're on the precipice
of retaking power

00:14:22.267 --> 00:14:24.734
and dismantling our democracy,
which is why Democrats

00:14:24.734 --> 00:14:26.634
must do everything possible
to stop them,

00:14:26.634 --> 00:14:29.567
not to mention addressing
a bunch of other urgent issues

00:14:29.567 --> 00:14:31.734
like climate change
for many reasons.

00:14:31.734 --> 00:14:33.501
We need to move
past fossil fuels.

00:14:33.501 --> 00:14:35.868
Hell, maybe we can make cars
that run on...

00:14:35.868 --> 00:14:37.501
-Diet Dr Pepper.

00:14:37.501 --> 00:14:40.234
[ Theme music plays ]

00:14:40.234 --> 00:14:41.567
We're all --

00:14:41.567 --> 00:14:44.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:44.467 --> 00:14:45.934
We're all --
We're all a little rusty.

00:14:45.934 --> 00:14:47.300
That -- You're not supposed
to hear that song yet.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.801
Just pretend like you
didn't hear the end of this.

00:14:49.801 --> 00:14:51.901
[ Laughter ]

00:14:54.234 --> 00:14:55.868
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:55.868 --> 00:14:59.067
[ Theme music plays ]

00:14:59.067 --> 00:15:01.934
God's Love We Deliver cooks
